{"id":"CG_162_02","names":{"Anxious Resident":"Anxious Resident","avg1_162":"Alina","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_229":"Filanis Slave"},"en":{"Anxious Resident":"Anxious Resident","avg1_162":"Alina","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_229":"Filanis Slave"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Two","The Name of Hers (Part II)","I want to be closer to you, stand by your side, and become a companion you can rely on."],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.0],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["bgm","m147"],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","A pinch of salt...==W== Let it sear until it's golden...",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_457"],["mrt",0,"z","013",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.7],["se","se_166"],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","009",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I'm back. Smells amazing...==W== What are you making?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Grilled fish. Just give it a second, it's almost done.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_162","a","018",null,null,-0.25,1.3,null,"diantou","OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_162","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","So that's how you do it...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","flurry","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Wh-what is it? You're staring so hard I'm getting distracted...==W== Don't tell me you hate fish?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Not at all. I'll eat anything as long as it's made well. That's not what I meant. It's just... I have a favor to ask.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Could you ...==W== teach me how to cook?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","021","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Sure, I can do that. But what brought this on?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I can't keep letting my guest do all the cooking. As the host, it's my job to take care of you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I really don't mind...==W== But alright, if you want to learn, I'll teach you.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","014","star",null],["say","avg3_100","Just a warning though, I won't go easy on you. You'd better be ready.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Of course. I wouldn't have it any other way.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["bgm","m149"],["show","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Let's start with the vegetables. Cut the potatoes into bite-sized pieces.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_551"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Understood. Bite-sized pieces...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","Whoa, stop, stop!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.3],["say","avg1_162","What is it?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","awkward",null],["say","avg3_100","Wait, you're not going to peel them? And these chunks are huge. How is anyone supposed to eat them?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",2.0],["say","avg1_162","You can eat the skin. And if they're too big, just bite them in half.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","I suppose the skin isn't completely inedible, but the texture is awful. Plus, they won't cook evenly if they're this big. And most of all, it's just a pain to eat!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","008","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I had no idea there were so many details to consider...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","018",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","You can't cut corners if you want good food. I'll handle the chopping. You just watch for now.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.75],["w",0.75],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",0.75],["se","se_178"],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Alright, the vegetables are soft. Time to season. Add some salt to taste for me.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_312"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Got it. To taste...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["mrt",1,"z","007",null,null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","Whoa, stop, stop!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Now what?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","019","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","You're just dumping the whole jar in? Aren't you going to use a spoon...?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","This is faster. Besides, if it's \"to taste,\" doesn't that mean I can just add as much as I want?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That's not what that means...==W== Let me ask you this, Alina. Do you like your food salty or mild?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","015",null,"jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Mild, I suppose.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Got it...==W== Alright, then just about this much. Here, try a sip.",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_178_stop"],["mrt",0,"z","013",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_239"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","018","star",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Oh, that's good...==W== If you knew exactly how much to add, why didn't you just say so?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","016","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","017",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Because everyone's palate is different. That's why I said \"to taste.\"",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,"niunie1"],["say","avg3_100","Figuring out what flavors your guest prefers, learning how each ingredient works...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","017","music",null],["say","avg3_100","Knowing all that before you even start cooking is the real secret to a good meal.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","So cooking requires just as much precision as swordplay. I never knew.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Haha, honestly, my half-baked skills came from a friend. I'm just copying what she taught me.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Let me guess...==W== Noya?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","question",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Yeah. Every dish Noya whipped up was a masterpiece. She used to teach me all the time.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I see...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","014","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","What kind of person is she... This Noya?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Eh?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","You've called me by her name more than once. It's hard not to be curious.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","story_character_112",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm","m17"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","... Fair enough. Let's see, how should I put it...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I guess her smile is the first thing that comes to mind. Her energy and warmth saved me more times than I can count.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","And she always looked out for me. She'd even share half her favorite drink with me...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","017",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Always shielding me. Making sure I never got hurt.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","... So you meant a great deal to her?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Now that you mention it, she did say something like that once.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Is that so...==W== And your habit of bending the rules? Did you pick that up from her too?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","021","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Ah...==W== Probably. Noya was always coming up with the wildest ideas.",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","023",null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Like when she decided to drive Loxy straight into that massive Stellaroid. Really scared the life out of me.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","011","question",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Stellaroid? Loxy?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Uh...==W== Just imagine ramming a carriage full-speed into a giant monster. Makes more sense?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","004","happy",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","017","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","What kind of strategy is that...?==W== It's completely reckless.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Haha, anyone would think so. But somehow, she pulled it off.",1,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","But ever since then, I just knew...==W== As long as Noya was by my side, no matter how crazy things got, we'd always find a way out.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","No matter how crazy...==W== I see. I think I understand why you're always so bold.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["cbg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutQuad",0.65,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Compared to her, I still have a long way to go.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Alright. I'll use her as my goal. Let's start by mastering the kitchen!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.65,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Anyway...==W== Thank you for telling me all this. I've got the soup recipe down.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","020","flower",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","021","attention",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","It's about time for the main course. I'll put everything I just learned to use. You can leave the rest to me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","012",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Al-Alright then.",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_020"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,"JuGong","OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Alina's so fired up. I'd better do my best to help her out.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phylanis_alina_home_daylight",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.25],["se","se_020_stop"],["w",0.25],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["obj","qstory_tales_02_001",0,null,0.6],["w",0.5],["se","se_095"],["say","avg1_162","Yeah...",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m4"],["mrt",1,"z","019","awkward",null],["say","avg3_100","For some reason, I'm not surprised.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["objx"],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_162","a","017",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,null,"jingxia","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","I was so careful to follow everything you said...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","It smells great, though! Terrible presentation doesn't always mean it tastes bad.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","You don't have to force it. I'll just throw this out...",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["mrt",1,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Don't mind if I do...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["se","se_371"],["w",0.3],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","013","exclamation",null,-0.25,1.3,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],